00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.780
if you've ever been to an improv show

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.200
it's short form improv

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.640
Basically, you're doing a scene, with two

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.640
random, made-up, bullshit characters

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.040
and then somebody can yell "change"

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.040
