00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:18.060
hit or miss. Because depending on what they

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.520
come up with is either absolutely

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.520
HILARIOUS or completely

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.520
